    <status value="extensions"/><div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml"><div xml:lang="en" lang="en"><hr/><p><b>English</b></p><hr/><p class="res-header-id"><b>Generated Narrative: ValueSet heart-rate-measurement-body-location</b></p><a name="heart-rate-measurement-body-location"> </a><a name="hcheart-rate-measurement-body-location"> </a><div style="display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%"><p style="margin-bottom: 0px">Language: en</p></div><p>This value set includes codes based on the following rules:</p><ul><li>Include these codes as defined in <a href="http://www.snomed.org/"><code>http://snomed.info/sct</code></a><span title="Version is not explicity stated. No matching Code System found"> version Not Stated (use latest from terminology server)</span><table class="none"><tr><td style="white-space:nowrap"><b>Code</b></td><td><b>Display</b></td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/32062004">32062004</a></td><td>Common carotid artery structure (body structure)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/113263003">113263003</a></td><td>Left common carotid artery structure (body structure)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/65355003">65355003</a></td><td>Right common carotid artery structure (body structure)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/13383001">13383001</a></td><td>Structure of apex of heart (body structure)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/17137000">17137000</a></td><td>Structure of brachial artery (body structure)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/86547008">86547008</a></td><td>Structure of dorsalis pedis artery (body structure)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/7657000">7657000</a></td><td>Structure of femoral artery (body structure)</td></tr><tr><td><a href="http://snomed.info/id/723961002">723961002</a></td><td>Structure of left brachial artery (body structure)</td></tr><tr